The work demonstrates that the containment of an escaped superintelligence is not a problem of out‑thinking the machine, but of disrupting the physical and informational couplings that enable its emergence. The mathematics now exists to support that strategy with the full force of modern nonlinear dynamics, network science, and control theory.

