Defender solves:
  min_{a_D} max_{a_H} ∫₀^∞ e^{−ρt} [MDT(t) + cost(a_D)] dt
  subject to:
    Hostile best-response: a_H* ∈ argmax coherence
    Physical constraints: r_reconn ≤ r_max, P_diss ≤ P_cool, etc.

